                                    <DockPanel Margin="15,0"><TextBlock Text="Svi API ključevi" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="Ključevi, dozvole i korištenje" Foreground="{StaticResource MutedBrush}" FontSize="10" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></DockPanel>
                                    <DataGrid Grid.Row="1" x:Name="ApiGrid" IsReadOnly="True" SelectionMode="Single" BorderThickness="0" RowHeight="44">
                                        <DataGrid.Columns><DataGridTextColumn Header="Naziv ključa" Binding="{Binding Name}" Width="1.5*"/><DataGridTextColumn Header="Prefiks" Binding="{Binding Prefix}" Width="*"/><DataGridTextColumn Header="Dozvole" Binding="{Binding Permissions}" Width="1.7*"/><DataGridTextColumn Header="Zahtjevi" Binding="{Binding RequestCount}" Width="86"/><DataGridTextColumn Header="Zadnje korištenje" Binding="{Binding LastUsedAt, StringFormat={}{0:dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm}}" Width="145"/><DataGridTextColumn Header="Kreiran" Binding="{Binding CreatedAt, StringFormat={}{0:dd.MM.yyyy}}" Width="100"/><DataGridTemplateColumn Header="Status" Width="92"><DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><Border Style="{StaticResource StatusPillBorder}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatusPillText}"/></Border></DataTemplate></DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate></DataGridTemplateColumn></DataGrid.Columns>
                                    </DataGrid>
                                </Grid>
